content:
Nʼafideyɛ atu aka ne ntadeɛ mu;
    wannwene ne daakye ho.
  Nʼasehweɛ yɛ nwanwa;
    obiara ankyekyere ne werɛ.
  “Ao Awurade hwɛ mʼamanehunu,
    ɛfiri sɛ ɔtamfoɔ adi nkonim.”

Wapoma ne bɛmma te sɛ ɔtamfoɔ;
    ne nsa nifa ayɛ krado.
  Sɛdeɛ ɔtamfoɔ yɛ no, wakunkum
    wɔn a wɔyɛ fɛ wɔ anisoɔ nyinaa;
  wahwie nʼabufuhyeɛ sɛ ogya
    agu Ɔbabaa Sion ntomadan so.

Wama nʼatenaeɛ ada mpan sɛ turo;
    wasɛe ne dwabirem.
  Awurade ama Sion werɛ afiri
    nʼafahyɛ ne home nna;
  wɔ nʼabufuhyeɛ mu no
    wabu ɔhene ne ɔsɔfoɔ animtia.

Wʼatamfoɔ nyinaa baeɛ wɔn anom
    kakraa tia wo;
  wɔsere na wɔtwɛre wɔn se
    na wɔka sɛ, “Yɛamene no.
  Ɛda a na yɛretwɛn no nie;
    Yɛatena ase ahunu.”

Meyɛɛ asredeɛ maa me nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa;
    wɔto akutia nnwom
    de di me ho fɛ ɛda mu nyinaa.

Nanso, seesei deɛ, wɔbiri sene wisiapunu;
    na wɔnhunu wɔn yie wɔ mmɔntene so.
  Wɔn wedeɛ atwintwam wɔ wɔn nnompe so;
    ɛho awo wesee sɛ abaa.
